# Business Data Digitization & Preprocessing Pipeline

This notebook implements an end-to-end pipeline for digitizing handwritten business ledgers into structured CSV datasets, followed by feature engineering and data quality verification. It is part of the broader CSCI323 Sales Forecasting project and serves as the upstream data preparation stage that produces the `dat.csv` / `project_dataset_preprocessed.csv` files consumed by the modeling notebook.

---

## Overview

The business operates physical handwritten registers to track daily warehouse inventory and customer sales. This notebook automates the conversion of scanned ledger images into machine-readable tabular data using the Gemini Vision API, then applies normalization, lag feature engineering, and mathematical verification to produce a clean, model-ready dataset.

The pipeline covers two distinct stages:

1. **Data Extraction** – Image-to-CSV conversion of handwritten ledger pages using Gemini 2.5 Flash.
2. **Preprocessing** – Feature engineering, lag/rolling mean computation, and targeted repair of early-period NaN values.

---

